### 2. **"no-sub-about" and "no-sub-about-section" Pattern**

These are **HTML/CSS class selectors** used to identify sections on the about page (not TypeScript constructs):

**In HTML** (`/views/pages/about/index.php`):
- `.no-sub-about-proof` — container for proof section (canvas + scenes)
- `.no-sub-about-proof__canvas-wrap` — wraps canvas element
- `.no-sub-about-proof__scene` — individual proof scene cards
- `.no-sub-about-proof__pin` — content pin within each scene
- `.no-sub-about-section` — wrapper class for all about sections

