### 3. **"scene-shell" Concept**

**What it is:** A CSS class + SCSS variable system that controls the **scroll span height** for each scene section.

**Key locations:**

**SCSS Variables** (`resource/scss/base/_root.scss`, line 28):
```scss
--scene-shell-span: 100vh;  // Default 100 viewport height units
```

**Applied by ScrollSceneRuntime** (`resource/ts/runtime/ScrollSceneRuntime.ts`, lines 414-427):
```typescript
private _applySceneShell(
  element: HTMLElement,
  scrollSpanVh: number,
): () => void {
  const shellClass = "scene-shell";
  element.classList.add(shellClass);
  element.style.setProperty("--scene-shell-span", `${scrollSpanVh}vh`);
  return () => {
    element.classList.remove(shellClass);
    element.style.removeProperty("--scene-shell-span");
  };
}
```

**Configuration in about.scene.ts** (lines 352-359):
```typescript
